  "question": {
    "text": "Let the sum of two positive integers be 24 . If the probability, that their product is not less than $\\frac{3}{4}$ times their greatest possible product, is $\\frac{m}{n}$, where $\\operatorname{gcd}(m, n)=1$, then $n-m$ equals",
